      "id": "claim_25b956f5858e42dcbe559ea6955ab44b",
      "statement": "@chrysalyst/core is a type-only package: its entry point packages/core/src/index.ts re-exports port declarations with `export type *`, so importing the package emits no runtime binding and pulls in no adapter.",
