    {
      "id": "claim_f939bf4cfa104e9b859549292e187750",
      "statement": "The type-only, dependency-free nature of @chrysalyst/core is an enforced invariant: packages/core/package.json declares no `dependencies`, and tests/workspace.test.ts fails if any non-test source file under packages/core/src imports a Node built-in or third-party module.",
